>
> The variable/argument "infzero" actually denotes the cases:
>
>    - "Inf * Zero +/- NaN"
>    - "Inf * Zero +/- NaN"
>    - "Zero * Inf +/- NaN"
>    - "Zero * Inf +/- NaN"
>
